                                "sense_id": "399a1ed1-31fa-35eb-844a-c2bb30405bcf",
                                "text": "Surely, then, a scheme that should supersede the necessity of saintship and sageship, would be a most valuable acquisition!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "74e4f926-4f14-4329-bb09-1041f35705c9",
                                "sense_id": "399a1ed1-31fa-35eb-844a-c2bb30405bcf",
                                "text": "That his sageship is fake is proved by the fact that he fathers a son after having supposedly renounced the world."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3dfa922e-b6e5-38c0-a715-c88f10228bd1",
